      "content": "it's kinda hard to find a comfortable position and it feels really intense. do you think i should just take like 800mg of ibuprofen every few hours to get ahead of the pain? i really don't want to have to go to the er if i can just sleep it off. it's probably just a bad strain from those boxes, right?",
